# Icon Placeholder

To use this extension, you'll need to create icon images in the following sizes:
- icon16.png (16x16 pixels)
- icon32.png (32x32 pixels)
- icon48.png (48x48 pixels)
- icon128.png (128x128 pixels)

You can use any icon design tool or online generator to create these icons.
For development purposes, you can use simple colored squares or download free icons from sites like:
- https://www.flaticon.com/
- https://icons8.com/
- https://www.iconfinder.com/

Place the generated icons in this directory.
